      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. it's a bit long though, maybe a little too wordy for my boss who prefers quick updates. can you make it shorter and more direct? also, try to emphasize how these extra tasks are just sneaking in when we aren't looking, which is making our original plan impossible to follow. like, it's just constantly creeping in and messing with the timeline.",
